  },
  "primaryContentSections" : [
    {
      "content" : [
        {
          "anchor" : "Overview",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Overview",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The Engineering Interest Group (EIG) is an events-based co-curriculuar activity that runs engineering-related",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "workshops and competitions.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "As a member of the Events subcommittee, I was responsible for:",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "items" : [
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "Writing event proposals",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "Preparing procurement forms for event logistics",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "Creating event materials, such as slides and scripts",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "Running dry-runs",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "Executing the event itself",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "text" : "(For competitions) managing the judging and prize process",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type" : "unorderedList"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "I later transferred to the Technical subcommittee, which was similar to the Events subcommittee but focused",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "more on the technical content taught during workshops.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Egg-Drop-Competition",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Egg Drop Competition",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "My first event was an Egg Drop competition, held after EIG’s annual general meeting. It involved a currency system,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "where teams could use points (including bonus points from the AGM) to purchase materials to protect their egg from",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "a drop at height. One twist we added was a “shark tank” mechanic, where teams could come up to the judges and pitch",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "their ideas - teams would be given extra points for creative and well-presented pitches.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "My team originally consisted of myself and two others, however one left midway through. One major achievement of this",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "event was that it ended on time, despite starting 10 minutes late - this speaks to our ability to plan for disruptions",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "ahead of time.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "One obstacle we had to overcome was choice of venue. Our original plan was to drop the eggs from outside the lecture",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "theatre, however the area underneath was already booked for a separate event. We ended up using another building slightly",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "further away, and had to rearrange some plans to account for the increased travel time to and from the venue.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Figma-Workshop",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Figma Workshop",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Figma is a software primarily used for digital design. Figma was supposed to be my first workshop, however it was",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "delayed from early 2026 to mid 2026. My team consisted of three others, all from different courses.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Figma was difficult to teach because the user interface has a lot of options. Teaching it fully in-slides was not",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "feasible, because we needed to show interactions between the cursor and the design elements. Teaching it fully in-Figma",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "was not desirable either, because certain parts of the interface had dozens of options that would need explanation.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "We settled on a hybrid method, where parts of the UI would be explained in slides first, then demonstrated using an app.",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "This approach was reused for the Figma workshops in IdeateComm, though run by other people.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Arduino-Workshop",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Arduino Workshop",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Arduino is a cheap microcontroller that is common in hobby electronics. The workshop focused on using the Arduino to",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "create a programmable car, capable of moving forward, backward, and braking autonomously. I was a helper in this event",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "rather than a planner, meaning that my involvement was limited to just the dry runs and running the workshop itself.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "One challenge we encountered was that the components used on the day itself were different from the components used for",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "testing - specifically, the exact model of Arduino was different. Unknown to us, the model used for the Arduino had lower",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "power limits than the one we had tested on. This meant that the Arduino was not capable of powering the motor unless",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "the motor was already moving, as it takes up to 4x the power to start a motor than to keep it going.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "We solved this issue by instructing participants to give the cars a small push to overcome the starting power requirements.",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "However, the issue still delayed the event by 30 minutes as we debugged the problem.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Excel-at-Excel-Workshop",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Excel at Excel Workshop",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Excel is the spreadsheet application created by Microsoft, and is common in Engineering contexts as it makes it easy to",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "calculate and manage many values at once. I was a helper in this event rather than a planner, meaning that my involvement",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "was limited to just the dry runs and running the workshop itself.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Since this was purely a software workshop, and Ngee Ann uses Microsoft for its office suite, the workshop ran very smoothly.",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "This Excel workshop significantly scaled back the amount of content taught due to feedback from prior years, however some",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "participants this year felt that it had now become too simple. Dialing in the difficulty was a major challenge.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "IdeateComm-Competition",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "IdeateComm Competition",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "IdeateComm is an annual community-focused competition run by EIG. The first day of the competition is the opening and",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "workshops, and the subsequent 3 days are the actual hackathon days. I was responsible for leading the 3D Modelling Workshop",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "on day 1 and helping to run the hackathon on days 2-4. I led part of the dry runs for Day 1 due to my experience with",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/Documentation\/documentation\/Documentation\/NP-Ambassadors",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : ", focusing on making travel and transitions between different segments as smooth as possible.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind" : "content"
    }
  ],
